      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "The experimental discovery of the Higgs boson confirmed a central piece of the Standard Model and was a landmark in particle physics.",
        "attribution": "The proposed names reflect leadership in the conception and construction of ATLAS and CMS, but the discovery was achieved by two very large collaborations.",
        "maturity": "The signal has been confirmed through extensive measurements of the Higgs boson's properties and decay channels.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Selecting a few individuals to represent the contributions of two collaborations is intrinsically difficult."
        ]
      }
    },
