        "attribution": "Katori and Ye made major, complementary contributions to the realization and refinement of the technology.",
        "maturity": "The precision advances are repeatedly demonstrated, though the full scientific reach of clocks at this level is still unfolding.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The distinction between the breakthrough invention and subsequent incremental improvements may shape the case."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "rank": 8,
