        "nobel_worthiness": "IceCube opened a new observational window on the high-energy universe by detecting astrophysical neutrinos.",
        "attribution": "Halzen's leadership was central, but the achievement rests on a large international collaboration and many instrumental contributions.",
        "maturity": "The observatory has established high-energy neutrino astronomy, although source identification and the field's broader scientific yield continue to develop.",
